THE FIX (read in full): the two preset-button lines now emit
`{{if eq $.PresetAttr "data-months"}}data-months="{{.Value}}"{{else}}data-preset="{{.Value}}"{{end}}`
— a static-literal attribute name selected by a conditional — replacing the
old `{{$.PresetAttr}}="{{.Value}}"` dynamic-attribute-name interpolation
that html/template silently rewrote to `ZgotmplZ`.

1. REAL ATTRIBUTE, NO ZgotmplZ, ALL FOUR PAGES (live render via
   scripts/whatif-verify.sh start 8098, server stopped after):
   - /dashboard: 0 ZgotmplZ; preset buttons carry real
     `data-preset="ytd"|"1m"|"2m"|"3m"|"6m"|"12m"|"all"`.
   - /insights: 0 ZgotmplZ IN THE PRESET BUTTONS (real `data-preset` values
     render correctly). BUT 2 `ZgotmplZ` DO appear on this page, in the
     From/To date `<input>` elements (lines 192/199 of the rendered HTML) —
     see OBSERVATION below; this is NOT in U7F's diff.
   - /explorer: 0 ZgotmplZ; real `data-months="0"|"1"|"2"|"3"|"6"|"12"`.
   - /major-expenses: 0 ZgotmplZ; real `data-months="0"|"1"|"2"|"3"|"6"|"12"`.

2. BEHAVIOR — preset click actually changes the date window (Playwright,
   headless chromium, all four pages driven, `btn.click()` then re-read
   `input[name=start]`/`input[type=date]`):
   - /dashboard 1M preset: dataset={preset:"1m"}; start 2026-01-01 → 2026-08-05 (changed=true)
   - /insights  1M preset: dataset={preset:"1m"}; start 2025-08-27 → 2026-08-05 (changed=true)
   - /explorer  3M preset: dataset={months:"3"}; start 2025-01-01 → 2026-05-27 (changed=true)
   - /major-expenses 3M preset: dataset={months:"3"}; start 2025-01-01 → 2026-05-27 (changed=true)
   No console errors on any page. `btn.dataset.preset`/`btn.dataset.months`
   now resolve (were `undefined` pre-fix); the click handlers fire and the
   date window updates on all four pages driven.

3. KEYBOARD OPERABILITY (real `page.keyboard.press('Enter')` after
   `btn.focus()`, not `.click()`):
   - /dashboard 1M preset: tag=BUTTON, type=button, tabIndex>=0; Enter
     changed start 2026-01-01 → 2026-08-05.
   - /explorer 3M preset: tag=BUTTON, type=button, tabIndex>=0; Enter
     changed start 2025-01-01 → 2026-05-27.
   Buttons were already real `<button type="button">` pre-fix; confirmed
   the attribute-name fix didn't disturb that (WCAG 2.2 AA 2.1.1, 4.1.2;
   ACCESSIBILITY.md #3, #9).

